PDO_MYSQL for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module pdo_mysql of
php82-pdo_mysql, the same build, with php82-mysqlnd-openssl instead of
php82-mysqlnd. The same files as php82-pdo_mysql: install one of the
two.

The module pdo_mysql of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/pdo_mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d,
its headers in include/php82/php/ext/pdo_mysql.
